----------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2013 Benjamin Watts, Daniel J. Lauk
Upstream:  https://github.com/benajamin/kkcalc
Licence:   zlib/libpng (full text: xraylabtool/data/kkcalc/LICENSE-kkcalc.txt)
